    "abstract": {
      "description": "<p>DoubleMuon primary dataset in NANOAOD format from RunH of 2016. Run period from run number 281613 to 284044.</p><p>The list of validated runs, which must be applied to all analyses, either with the full validation or for an analysis requiring only muons, can be found in:</p>",
